               <exData contentType="text/html">
                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/>My signature below indicates acceptance of the GRAD PLUS Loan as specified. I agree to report to the Office of Financial Aid any change in my academic or California residency status, and any additional resources received including, but not limited to loans, scholarships, stipends, and grants from outside sources. I understand any changes may result in a reduction of awards and billing for financial aid received. If I withdraw or drop classes, repayment may be required.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">I understand the requirements for enrollment and Satisfactory Academic Progress. I understand a change in enrollment may result in reduction or cancellation of my financial aid award, and any refund to which I am entitled will first be remitted to the Direct Loan Program.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">I accept responsibility for repayment of any loans awarded to me. I understand that I must be enrolled<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">at least half-time</span> to remain eligible for loan funds. I understand that loan recipients are required by law to complete an exit interview prior to graduating, withdrawing from all classes, dropping below half- time status, or taking a leave of absence. University records may be held if I do not complete loan exit counseling.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p></body>
